  "body": "This closes #1213, matching Edge, Chrome Canary, and Safari Tech Preview, and simplifying the\nlogic nicely.\n\nI have created a test at https://ns-novwypmefn.now.sh which I am planning to upstream to web platform tests if this gets accepted. The results are:\n- Chrome stable: fails with timeout (second navigation during unload aborted the first navigation)\n- Chrome canary: passes (second navigation during unload was ignored)\n- Safari Tech Preview: passes (second navigation during unload was ignored)\n- Edge 38.14393.0.0/14.14393: passes (second navigation during unload was ignored)\n- Firefox stable: fails (both the first and second navigation seem to have happened)\n\n/cc @lucasgadani\n",
